    },
    {
      "y": 73.76881408691406,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "5) 个人信息主体的权利和实现机制，如查询方法、更正方法、删除方法、注",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 89.89664459228516,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "销账户的方法、撤回授权同意的方法、获取个人信息副本的方法、对信息",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 105.14334106445312,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "系统自动决策结果进行投诉的方法等；",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 120.58876037597656,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "6) 提供个人信息后可能存在的安全风险，及不提供个人信息可能产生的影",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 136.34335327148438,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "响；",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 151.7887725830078,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "7) 遵循的个人信息安全基本原则，具备的数据安全能力，以及采取的个人信",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 167.89663696289062,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "息安全保护措施，必要时可公开数据安全和个人信息保护相关的合规证",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 183.14334106445312,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "明；",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 198.58876037597656,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "8) 处理个人信息主体询问、投诉的渠道和机制，以及外部纠纷解决机构及联",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 214.34335327148438,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "络方式。",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 229.7887725830078,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "b) 个人信息保护政策所告知的信息应真实、准确、完整；",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 245.38880920410156,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "c) 个人信息保护政策的内容应清晰易懂，符合通用的语言习惯，使用标准化的数",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 261.1433410644531,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "字、图示等，避免使用有歧义的语言；",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 276.6187744140625,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "d) 个人信息保护政策应公开发布且易于访问，例如，在网站主页、移动互联网应",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 292.3733215332031,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "用程序安装页、附录C中的交互界面或设计等显著位置设置链接；",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 307.81878662109375,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "e) 个人信息保护政策应逐一送达个人信息主体。当成本过高或有显著困难时，可",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 323.5733337402344,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "以公告的形式发布；",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 339.0187683105469,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "f) 在a）所载事项发生变化时，应及时更新个人信息保护政策并重新告知个人信",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 354.7733459472656,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "息主体。",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 371.7590026855469,
      "size": 9.0,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "注1：组织会习惯性将个人信息保护政策命名为“隐私政策”或其他名称，其内容宜与个人信息保护",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 387.3590087890625,
      "size": 9.0,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "政策内容保持一致。",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 402.958984375,
      "size": 9.0,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "注2：个人信息保护政策的内容可参考附录D。",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 418.5589904785156,
      "size": 9.0,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "注3：在个人信息主体首次打开产品或服务、注册账户等情形时，宜通过弹窗等形式主动向其展示个",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 434.15899658203125,
      "size": 9.0,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "人信息保护政策的主要或核心内容，帮助个人信息主体理解该产品或服务的个人信息处理范围和",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 449.7590026855469,
      "size": 9.0,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "规则，并决定是否继续使用该产品或服务。",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 472.4389343261719,
      "size": 10.5600004196167,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "5.6 征得授权同意的例外",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": true,
      "heading_score": 1.0
    },
    {
      "y": 495.5466003417969,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "以下情形中，个人信息控制者收集、使用个人信息不必征得个人信息主体的授权同",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 511.1466369628906,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "意：",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 526.23876953125,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "a) 与个人信息控制者履行法律法规规定的义务相关的；",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 541.8387451171875,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "b) 与国家安全、国防安全直接相关的；",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 557.4387817382812,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "c) 与公共安全、公共卫生、重大公共利益直接相关的；",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 573.0387573242188,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "d) 与刑事侦查、起诉、审判和判决执行等直接相关的；",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 588.6387939453125,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "e) 出于维护个人信息主体或其他个人的生命、财产等重大合法权益但又很难得到",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 604.393310546875,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "本人授权同意的；",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 619.8387451171875,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "f) 所涉及的个人信息是个人信息主体自行向社会公众公开的；",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 635.4387817382812,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "g) 根据个人信息主体要求签订和履行合同所必需的；",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 652.6089477539062,
      "size": 9.0,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "注：个人信息保护政策的主要功能为公开个人信息控制者收集、使用个人信息范围和规则，不宜将其",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 668.208984375,
      "size": 9.0,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "视为合同。",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 682.268798828125,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "h) 从合法公开披露的信息中收集个人信息的，如合法的新闻报道、政府信息公开",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 698.0233154296875,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "等渠道；",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 713.46875,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "i) 维护所提供产品或服务的安全稳定运行所必需的，如发现、处置产品或服务的",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 729.223388671875,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "故障；",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 744.664794921875,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "j) 个人信息控制者为新闻单位，且其开展合法的新闻报道所必需的；",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
